# **`34_linear_algebra.lc` (Vectors, Matrices, & Transforms)**
# **Purpose**: Matrix math for 2D/3D graphics, physics simulations, and statistics.
# **Contents**:
# `VEC2`, `VEC3`, `VEC4` vector constructors and dot/cross product (`dot_prod`, `cross_prod`).
# Matrix structures: `MAT2`, `MAT3`, `MAT4`, `mat_mul`, `mat_transpose`, `mat_determinant`, `mat_inverse`.
# Vector normalization, distance, and 3D projection transformations.

